// REQUIRES: long
// P03.24 Done-when size for the operator checks, shape `chain`: a generated
// program of size 100000 checks without a crash and in near-linear time
// (`timeout`, also in the ASan build). One test per shape so lit runs the
// shapes in parallel. The parser allows 1024 levels of nesting, so a chain of
// operands is cut into expressions of 1000 operands (the same limit holds for
// an `int` sum).
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-ops-stress.py chain 100000 > %t.gopp
// RUN: timeout 30 %gopp check -check-j=1 --check-error-limit=0 %t.gopp
package main
